    "title": "Minimum Number of Arrows to Burst Balloons",
    "category": "Greedy",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Each balloon is represented by an interval on a number line. One arrow shot vertically bursts every balloon intersecting that point. Determine the minimum number of arrows required to burst all balloons.",
